{"authored" [{"question" "q-114557" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{8\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\frac{8}{{x}^{5}}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{8}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{2}{{x}^{4}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{2}{{x}^{4}})-\\int (-\\frac{2}{{x}^{4}})(\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{4}}+2\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{4}}-\\frac{1}{2{x}^{4}}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1}{2{x}^{4}}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7f007e4d35389d9b739a877bdebd629961f7f4c5f44fdefff4a6860a90b66c95" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1}{4{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-3}{{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1}{2{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+2}{{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1}{4{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1}{2{x}^{4}}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{4}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4} \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{4}⁡(2x)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})-\\int (-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{4}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}(-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-\\frac{1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{4}⁡(2x)=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7f007e4d35389d9b739a877bdebd629961f7f4c5f44fdefff4a6860a90b66c95" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{6\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{2{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aa38037df6f95a2eef424da3ef13af3ea5c2025f7c24df111c7a4d1febae3b9" "basis" 1324 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114556" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:a